<title>USA: Anheuser-Busch files $700 mln shelf debt.</title>
<headline>Anheuser-Busch files $700 mln shelf debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anheuser-Busch Cos Inc filed Friday a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Comission for up to $700 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>When added to previous registrations, the company will have up to $800 million of debt securities available for sale.</p>
<p>The company said net proceeds will be used for general corprate purposes.</p>
</text>
